      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOCIALISM (4) is worth forgiving for her last effort when seventh (39.38) at Ballarat over 660m. Solid record here winning five races. Has winning claims on her best figures. MEPUNGA SANDY (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (35.45) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning three races. Should be in this for a long way. GREYSYND SAMMY (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 9 lengths at Sandown (34.66). Goes very well at course and distance boasting two wins. Worth following up. DOONGALLA PARODY (5) should be thereabouts.",
